# Captures of commercial interfaces.
#
# Showing these to a class is fair dealing for illustration for instruction;
# a public repository is not that, and unlike the government captures beside
# them these carry no licence that permits republication. They stay on disk and
# travel to Moodle with the teardown deck.
#
# The two slides that used them are redrawn instead — labelled as drawings, with
# the live page linked — so the deck is complete for anyone who clones this.
modules/sd/datasets/screens/flows/news-bbc/
modules/sd/datasets/screens/flows/shop-screwfix/

.DS_Store
~$*

# Build artefacts. v3.zip is a 7.9 MB snapshot of an earlier version of this
# same repository, nested .git and all, committed in March 2025. Nothing depends
# on it and nothing should. It stays on disk; it is not tracked.
v3.zip
*.zip
